msgid "深度学习专项学习"
msgstr "Deep Learning Specialization"

msgid ""
"系统性地学习 Andrew Ng 深度学习五门课程，涵盖神经网络基础、超参数调优、结构化机器学习、CNN、RNN "
"与注意力机制等核心领域。完成所有课程的笔记整理与代码实践，构建个人 AI 知识体系。"
msgstr ""
"Systematically studied Andrew Ng's Deep Learning Specialization, covering "
"neural networks, hyperparameter tuning, structured ML, CNN, RNN, and "
"attention mechanisms. Completed all course notes and coding exercises, "
"building a personal AI knowledge system."

msgid "Web 开发与全栈探索"
msgstr "Web Development & Full-Stack"

msgid ""
"深入学习 Django 框架，从后端 API 设计到前端模板渲染，掌握了完整的 Web "
"开发流程。搭建个人博客系统，将学习过程中的思考与笔记沉淀为结构化的知识输出。"
msgstr ""
"Deep-dived into Django framework, from backend API design to frontend "
"template rendering, mastering the full web development workflow. Built a "
"personal blog system to transform learning into structured knowledge output."

msgid "Python 与数据科学入门"
msgstr "Python & Data Science"

msgid ""
"从 Python 基础语法开始，逐步深入到 NumPy、Pandas、Matplotlib 等数据科学生态工具。建立扎实的编程基础，为后续的 AI "
"学习奠定了坚实的技术根基。"
msgstr ""
"Started with Python basics, then progressed to NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib and"
" other data science tools. Built a solid programming foundation for future "
"AI learning."

msgid "更早之前"
msgstr "Earlier Days"

msgid "对技术的原始好奇"
msgstr "Original Curiosity for Technology"

msgid ""
"对计算机科学的兴趣始于对\"机器如何思考\"这一问题的好奇。从第一行 Hello World 到如今能够训练神经网络模型，每一步都是对未知世界的探索。"
msgstr ""
"My interest in computer science began with wondering 'how machines think.' "
"From the first Hello World to training neural networks, every step has been "
"an exploration of the unknown."

msgid "关于坚持"
msgstr "On Persistence"

msgid "\"学习 AI 不是一场短跑，而是一场没有终点的马拉松。重要的是每天都比昨天多理解一点点。\""
msgstr ""
"\"Learning AI is not a sprint, but a marathon without a finish line. What "
"matters is understanding a little more than yesterday.\""

msgid ""
"坚持做深度学习笔记整理这件事，已经成为了我日常生活的一部分。起初只是为了记录课程中的关键概念，但随着笔记越积越多，我发现这个过程本身比学习课程更有价值。写笔记不是简单的摘抄，而是强迫自己用最清晰的语言重新组织知识，在反复的推敲和修改中，很多曾经模糊的概念突然变得清晰起来。"
msgstr ""
"Keeping deep learning notes has become part of my daily routine. Initially "
"just for recording course concepts, I found the process itself more valuable"
" than the courses. Note-taking isn't copying - it forces me to reorganize "
"knowledge in the clearest language, and through repeated refinement, many "
"fuzzy concepts suddenly become clear."

msgid ""
"在这个过程中，我深刻体会到：真正的学习不是\"听过\"或\"看过\"，而是能够用自己的语言重新表达，并且能够将不同领域的知识连接起来。深度学习的美妙之处在于，它不是一个孤立的学科——它连接着数学、统计学、计算机科学和认知科学，每一次学习都像是在拼图中加入新的一块。"
msgstr ""
"Through this process, I deeply realized: real learning isn't 'hearing' or "
"'seeing' - it's being able to re-express in your own words and connect "
"knowledge across domains. Deep learning's beauty lies in connecting "
"mathematics, statistics, computer science, and cognitive science - each "
"piece of learning adds a new tile to the mosaic."

msgid ""
"最让我感到满足的时刻，不是完成某门课程，也不是跑通了某个模型，而是在某个深夜写笔记时，忽然发现自己在几个月前记下的疑问，如今已经有了自己的答案。这种\"过去和现在的自己对话\"的感觉，是自学路上最珍贵的体验。"
msgstr ""
"The most satisfying moments aren't finishing courses or running models, but "
"suddenly finding answers to questions I wrote months ago during late-night "
"note sessions. This 'dialogue between past and present self' is the most "
"precious experience on the self-learning journey."

msgid "不止代码"
msgstr "Beyond Code"

msgid "阅读技术论文"
msgstr "Reading Research Papers"

msgid ""
"喜欢在 ArXiv 上浏览最新的 AI 论文，尤其关注 CV 和 NLP 领域的前沿进展。虽然很多论文读起来吃力，但每理解一个新 idea 都让人兴奋。"
msgstr ""
"I enjoy browsing the latest AI papers on ArXiv, especially CV and NLP "
"advances. Though many papers are challenging, understanding each new idea is"
" thrilling."

msgid "开源社区"
msgstr "Open Source Community"

msgid "关注 GitHub 上优秀的开源项目，学习优秀工程师的代码风格和架构设计。希望有一天自己的项目也能被别人 Star。"
msgstr ""
"I follow great open-source projects on GitHub, learning from excellent "
"engineers' code style and architecture. Hope my projects will be starred "
"someday."

msgid "写作与表达"
msgstr "Writing & Expression"

msgid "相信清晰的写作是清晰思考的外在表现。无论是技术笔记还是个人感悟，都力求用简洁、准确的语言传达复杂的思想。"
msgstr ""
"I believe clear writing is the reflection of clear thinking. Whether "
"technical notes or personal insights, I strive to convey complex ideas with "
"concise, precise language."

msgid "持续学习"
msgstr "Continuous Learning"

msgid "技术之外，也在关注产品设计、认知科学和个人效率提升方法。好的工程师不应该只埋头写代码，更要理解人与技术的关系。"
msgstr ""
"Beyond technology, I follow product design, cognitive science, and personal "
"productivity. A good engineer shouldn't just write code, but understand the "
"relationship between people and technology."

msgid "姓名"
msgstr "Name"

msgid "完成 Andrew Ng 深度学习五门课程，掌握神经网络、CNN、RNN、注意力机制等核心技术。"
msgstr ""
"Completed Andrew Ng's Deep Learning Specialization, mastering neural "
"networks, CNN, RNN, and attention mechanisms."

msgid ""
"热爱深度学习与人工智能技术，具备扎实的数学基础和编程能力。善于将复杂的 AI 概念转化为清晰易懂的文档和笔记。注重代码质量和工程实践，持续学习前沿技术。"
msgstr ""
"Passionate about deep learning and AI, with solid mathematical foundations "
"and programming skills. Skilled at translating complex AI concepts into "
"clear documentation and notes. Focused on code quality and engineering "
"practices, continuously learning cutting-edge technologies."

