msgid ""
"2015 "
"年从大连海事大学船舶电气工程专业毕业后，赴日留学并在东京海洋大学完成了硕士与博士课程。十年的学术训练不仅奠定了扎实的工程基础，也培养了跨文化环境下独立研究的能力。研究兴趣涉及海洋科技、自动化控制与人工智能的交叉领域。"
msgstr ""
"After graduating from Dalian Maritime University in 2015, I went to Japan "
"and completed my Master's and PhD at Tokyo University of Marine Science and "
"Technology. A decade of academic training laid a solid engineering "
"foundation and cultivated the ability to conduct independent research. My "
"research interests span marine technology, automation control, and AI."

msgid "AI / 机器学习"
msgstr "AI / Machine Learning"

msgid "Bilibili/YouTube/Podcast 批量导入 NotebookLM"
msgstr "Batch Import Bilibili/YouTube/Podcast to NotebookLM"

msgid "Chrome 扩展"
msgstr "Chrome Extension"

msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

msgid "RAG · 大语言模型"
msgstr "RAG · Large Language Models"

msgid ""
"一款基于 WXT + React + TypeScript 构建的 Chrome 扩展（Manifest V3），支持从 "
"Bilibili、YouTube、Apple Podcasts、小宇宙、Web 页面、AI 对话等多种来源批量导入内容到 Google "
"NotebookLM。采用 Side Panel UI 设计，自动识别当前站点并匹配导入工具，支持多账号切换、目标笔记本选择、PDF 聚合、AI "
"对话分享卡片等高级功能。100% 客户端处理，不上传任何用户数据。"
msgstr ""
"A Chrome extension (Manifest V3) built with WXT + React + TypeScript that "
"batch-imports content from Bilibili, YouTube, Apple Podcasts, Xiaoyuzhou FM,"
" web pages, and AI chats into Google NotebookLM. Features Side Panel UI, "
"multi-account switching, target notebook selection, PDF aggregation, AI "
"share cards, and more. 100% client-side — no data uploaded."

msgid "业务范围"
msgstr "Scope of Work"

msgid "个人贡献"
msgstr "My Contribution"

msgid "主导新技術（YOLO·ROS）导入，推动产品智能化升级"
msgstr ""
"Led the introduction of new technologies (YOLO·ROS) to drive product "
"intelligence upgrades"

msgid ""
"从 PLC 底层控制到 AI 图像识别，再到全栈 Web 和 Chrome "
"扩展开发，我具备跨越多层技术栈的实践能力。在机械设备制造商的核心研发部门，我负责产品搭载软件的全栈开发，同时主导新技术（YOLO·ROS）的导入与推广——从技术选型、可行性验证到落地部署，全程推动产品智能化升级。"
msgstr ""
"From PLC-level control to AI image recognition to full-stack web and Chrome "
"extension development, I have practical experience spanning multiple "
"technology layers. In the core R&D department, I am responsible for full-"
"stack development of onboard software while leading the introduction of new "
"technologies (YOLO·ROS) — from technology selection to deployment."

msgid "从零实现 RAG 完整流水线：文档分割 → 向量化 → 检索 → LLM 生成"
msgstr ""
"Implemented complete RAG pipeline from scratch: chunking → vectorization → "
"retrieval → LLM generation"

msgid "关注 GitHub 优秀开源项目，学习代码风格与架构设计。将自己的项目也开源在 GitHub 上，希望为社区贡献价值。"
msgstr ""
"I follow great open-source projects on GitHub, learning from excellent code "
"styles and architectures. I also open-source my own projects, hoping to "
"contribute value to the community."

msgid "关注产品设计、认知科学和个人效率提升方法。不同领域的知识交叉往往能带来意想不到的启发。"
msgstr ""
"I follow product design, cognitive science, and personal productivity "
"methods. Cross-pollination between different fields often brings unexpected "
"insights."

msgid "兴趣与关注"
msgstr "Interests & Focus"

msgid "前端开发"
msgstr "Frontend Development"

msgid ""
"博士课程修了后，加入古河机械金属株式会社（古河ロックドリル），在开发设计部从事产品搭载软件的全栈开发。从 PLC 底层控制到 AI "
"图像识别，覆盖了工业自动化系统的完整技术栈。"
msgstr ""
"After completing my PhD, I joined Furukawa Rock Drill in the R&D Department,"
" doing full-stack development of onboard software. From PLC-level control to"
" AI image recognition, covering the complete technology stack of industrial "
"automation systems."

msgid "参与 Keyence 公司技术实习，了解工厂自动化与检测设备的前沿技术。"
msgstr ""
"Participated in a technical internship at Keyence, learning about factory "
"automation and cutting-edge inspection equipment."

msgid "参与电气 / 油压回路设计、CREO 3D 建模，实现软硬件协同开发"
msgstr ""
"Participated in electrical/hydraulic circuit design and CREO 3D modeling for"
" software-hardware co-development"

msgid "参与车载音响系统的开发实习，了解嵌入式音频处理与车载电子系统架构。"
msgstr ""
"Participated in an automotive audio system development internship, learning "
"about embedded audio processing and vehicle electronics."

msgid "古河机械金属株式会社 · 正社員"
msgstr "Furukawa Rock Drill · Full-time Employee"

msgid "后端 / DevOps"
msgstr "Backend / DevOps"

msgid ""
"在业余时间，我通过个人项目持续拓宽技术边界——从计算机视觉流水线到 RAG 智能问答系统，再到已上架 Chrome Web Store "
"的浏览器扩展。这些项目既是学习驱动，也是对「技术如何改善日常生活」的持续探索。"
msgstr ""
"In my spare time, I continuously expand my technical boundaries through "
"personal projects — from computer vision pipelines to RAG QA systems to "
"Chrome extensions published on the Chrome Web Store. These projects are both"
" learning-driven and a continuous exploration of how technology can improve "
"daily life."

msgid ""
"在某大型机械制造商的核心研发部门，从事产品搭载软件的全栈开发。涵盖 PLC 基本控制（シーケンス制御、モーション制御）、ROS 自动化流程构建、YOLO"
" 图像识别算法实现等多个控制层级。同时参与电气回路 / 油压回路设计、CREO 机械设计，从软硬件两端推动产品升级。"
msgstr ""
"Working in the core R&D department of a major machinery manufacturer, doing "
"full-stack development of onboard software. Covers multiple control layers: "
